flowchart TD
  A[next video in directory] --> B{row in shrink database<br/>path + size + mtime?}
  B -- yes --> S[skip - database has precedence]
  B -- no --> C{first video stream<br/>already HEVC?}
  C -- yes --> R1[record in DB, no re-encode]
  C -- no --> E[ffmpeg libx265 -> newShrinkedFiles/]
  E --> V{exit 0, video stream,<br/>duration matches?}
  V -- no --> F[log FAILED, original kept, continue]
  V -- yes --> K{--keep-copies?}
  K -- yes --> KC[keep copy, record nothing]
  K -- no --> W[copy into original inode + record<br/>no interruption in between]
